
# Python build output must never reach the GPL source shipment. A committed
# pixel_diff.cpython-310.pyc carried an upstream author's macOS home path into
# the tarball that ships in the desktop package. export-ignore keeps it out of
# `git archive` without rewriting history or folding this tree's local
# modifications -- which ship separately as a patch -- into HEAD.
# regen-source.sh passes --worktree-attributes so this file applies uncommitted.
**/__pycache__/** export-ignore
*.pyc export-ignore
